        "original_id": "fb00a2e1-f74b-5075-bb64-b4f8c75f814e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kamāl al-Dīn al-Fārisī; M. A. Muqtedar Khan\n- Roles: Persian Muslim scientist; professor\n- Organizations: University of Delaware\n- Topics: Political science; international relations\n\nFacts:\n- Kamāl al-Dīn al-Fārisī, also known as Kamal al-Din Hasan ibn Ali ibn Hasan al-Farisi or Abu Hasan Muhammad ibn Hasan, was born in 1267.\n- M. A. Muqtedar Khan, whose full name is Muhammad Abdul Muqtedar Khan, was born in 1966.\n- Kamāl al-Dīn al-Fārisī was a prominent Persian Muslim scientist.\n- Kamāl al-Dīn al-Fārisī died on 12 January 1319, although his death was long assumed to have occurred in 1320.\n- M. A. Muqtedar Khan is a professor in the Department of Political Science and International Relations at the University of Delaware.",
